@title 3D Heat vents: air in and air out balance (solver fluxes) with a fan and a grille
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The hot cooling-advice cabinet: a first Quick run, then the Cooling selection adds the filter fan and a grille, and a second run measures both openings. The Vents and fans panel shows per-opening labels and the balance line, in m3/h, with in and out equal.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Settings for the next run"
wait 10
click_text Quick
wait 10
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 200
expect_not "Preliminary"
move 700 650
wait 10
click_text "Cooling selection"
wait 10
click_text "Add the filter fan and a grille to the cabinet"
wait 20
shot 01-before-the-run-with-openings
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 250
expect_not "Preliminary"
expect "Air in"
expect "m³/h (model)"
expect "Model estimate, not a measurement"
shot 02-vents-and-fans-balance
check_layout
check_blank 02-vents-and-fans-balance
